@ExchangeRate_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login (copiar el token de la respuesta en la variable @token)
POST {{ExchangeRate_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_AQUI

### 2. Convertir un monto
POST {{ExchangeRate_HostAddress}}/api/exchange/convert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100, "fromCurrency": "USD", "toCurrency": "PEN" }

### 3. Actualizar un tipo de cambio
POST {{ExchangeRate_HostAddress}}/api/exchange/rate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromCurrency": "USD", "toCurrency": "PEN", "rate": 3.80 }
